Exactly SIX COLUMNS x FOUR ROWS, 24 WHOLE figure frames, generous transparent gutters, output landscape 1536x1024 if possible. Every row is one DIRECTION, every column one phase. ROW1 SOUTH/front, ROW2 WEST/left side, ROW3 NORTH/back, ROW4 EAST/right side. Interpret WEST/EAST as character facing the left/right edge of the image, not viewer's right/left. Back views MUST show the back of the head and clothing, never a face painted on the back. Proper RPG top-down camera consistent with reference2, no isometric.
