col1 neutral exhaled stance, original reference pose;
col2 subtle inhalation at chest and shoulders, slight hair/cloth lift;
col3 breath apex, small coherent hair-tip/coat-hem movement;
col4 gentle exhale and settling fabric;
col5 return toward original neutral stance, calm open eyes;
col6 a SINGLE NATURAL BLINK, eyes softly CLOSED in views where eyes are visible, otherwise same back-view body with slight hair settle. Cols1-5 EYES OPEN in visible faces, col6 CLOSED. Mouth remains natural and closed, not speaking.
